Package: withinr
Title: High-Performance Fixed Effects Solver
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexander", "Fischer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "alexander-fischer1801@t-online.de"),
    person("Kristof", "Schroeder", role = "aut"),
    person("Authors of the bundled Rust crates", role = "cph",
           comment = "See inst/COPYRIGHTS for authorship and license details"))
Description: Fast modified LSMR solvers with Schwarz and diagonal
    preconditioners for absorbing high-dimensional fixed effects in panel
    data regressions. The computational core is written in Rust via the
    'within' crate and accessed through 'extendr'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: See inst/COPYRIGHTS for bundled Rust dependencies.
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.85)
URL: https://github.com/py-econometrics/within
BugReports: https://github.com/py-econometrics/within/issues
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
